              "widgetType": "html",
              "settings": {
                "html": "<section class=\"py-14 bg-[#F5EDE4] border-t border-b border-[#1A0F0A]/10\">\n  <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-12\">\n    <div class=\"mb-12 space-y-3\">\n      <span class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-[#C86D51]\">Real People, Real Joy</span>\n      <h2 class=\"font-serif-luxury text-3xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-[#1A0F0A]\">What our customers say about our chocolate</h2>\n      <p class=\"text-[#5C4A3E] text-base leading-relaxed max-w-2xl\">Watch chocolate lovers across Ghana sample Cherelle and Nahar artisanal creations live in supermarkets, pop-up lounges, and luxury retail stores.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-8\">\n      <!-- Reel 1 -->\n      <div class=\"bg-[#1A0F0A] rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-[#1A0F0A]/10 shadow-lg flex flex-col justify-between\">\n        <div class=\"aspect-[9/16] relative overflow-hidden\">\n          <iframe class=\"w-full h-full border-0\" src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1JUC7nwQjQpqLD8z7WnyhiyPtkV6rkcvG/preview\" allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n          <div class=\"absolute top-3 left-3 bg-[#D4AF37] text-[#1A0F0A] text-[10px] font-bold uppercase px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow pointer-events-none\">Live Sampling</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-5 bg-[#F5EDE4] space-y-1\">\n          <h5 class=\"font-serif-luxury text-base font-bold text-[#1A0F0A]\">Supermarket Tasting Reel #1</h5>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-[#5C4A3E]\">Customers discovering Cherelle 45% Milk Chocolate.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <!-- Reel 2 -->\n      <div class=\"bg-[#1A0F0A] rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-[#1A0F0A]/10 shadow-lg flex flex-col justify-between\">\n        <div class=\"aspect-[9/16] relative overflow-hidden\">\n          <iframe class=\"w-full h-full border-0\" src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1pKLN1VVG15IKg_WP6RUlZ8eD3UJnX1yW/preview\" allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n          <div class=\"absolute top-3 left-3 bg-[#C86D51] text-white text-[10px] font-bold uppercase px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow pointer-events-none\">Nahar Luxury Tasting</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-5 bg-[#F5EDE4] space-y-1\">\n          <h5 class=\"font-serif-luxury text-base font-bold text-[#1A0F0A]\">Grand Reserve Sampling #2</h5>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-[#5C4A3E]\">Discerning palates savoring Nahar 72% Obsidian Dark.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <!-- Reel 3 -->\n      <div class=\"bg-[#1A0F0A] rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-[#1A0F0A]/10 shadow-lg flex flex-col justify-between\">\n        <div class=\"aspect-[9/16] relative overflow-hidden\">\n          <iframe class=\"w-full h-full border-0\" src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/15lB6wkq0Cg6NT4pACbXxZiokmdDYtcE0/preview\" allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n          <div class=\"absolute top-3 left-3 bg-[#D4AF37] text-[#1A0F0A] text-[10px] font-bold uppercase px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow pointer-events-none\">Retail Pop-Up</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-5 bg-[#F5EDE4] space-y-1\">\n          <h5 class=\"font-serif-luxury text-base font-bold text-[#1A0F0A]\">Accra Retail Pop-Up #3</h5>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-[#5C4A3E]\">Interactive tasting counter at Accra shopping mall.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <!-- Reel 4 -->\n      <div class=\"bg-[#1A0F0A] rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-[#1A0F0A]/10 shadow-lg flex flex-col justify-between\">\n        <div class=\"aspect-[9/16] relative overflow-hidden\">\n          <iframe class=\"w-full h-full border-0\" src=\"https://drive.google.com/file/d/1FQK5L6ErULSbr0Wd_VKoGYcJo463HVYC/preview\" allow=\"autoplay; encrypted-media\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n          <div class=\"absolute top-3 left-3 bg-[#B8854A] text-white text-[10px] font-bold uppercase px-3 py-1 rounded-full shadow pointer-events-none\">Family & Kids Joy</div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"p-5 bg-[#F5EDE4] space-y-1\">\n          <h5 class=\"font-serif-luxury text-base font-bold text-[#1A0F0A]\">Joy in Every Bite #4</h5>\n          <p class=\"text-xs text-[#5C4A3E]\">Delighting young chocolate lovers with Cherelle treats.</p>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>"
